  specifically to `192.168.7.5:8443`, and `gogetter` successfully completed a TCP connection to it.
  The test listener was immediately removed, leaving no service listening on `8443`.
- The owner selected persistent Workpc access independent of VS Code sessions. The operating
  contract now requires a localhost-only managed SSH tunnel with automatic startup and recovery.
- Code inspection found no dashboard email, webhook, or OpenAI/API sender. The live development
